ng.","short_summary":"Locate a named campus performance venue.","evidence_claim":"UAH’s campus map lists the Robert E. James Black Box Theatre as a campus destination.","source_url":"https://www.uah.edu/map","source_title":"Campus Map | The University of Alabama in Huntsville","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Performance access, dates, and ticket requirements vary; consult the current event listing.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"uah-charger-park","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Charger Park","title":"9. Find Charger Park for a future game","subtitle":"Map-listed athletics destination","notes":"Make a daylight walk to Charger Park and note the route from central campus. Use the athletics schedule later to choose an appropriate event to attend.","short_summary":"Add a named athletics destination to your mental map.","evidence_claim":"UAH’s campus map lists Charger Park as a campus destination.","source_url":"https://www.uah.edu/map","source_title":"Campus Map | The University of Alabama in Huntsville","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Facility access and event admission vary; check the current athletics schedule before returning.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"huntsville-big-spring-park","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Big Spring Park","title":"10. If you have transportation, end at Big Spring Park","subtitle":"200 Church Street, Huntsville","notes":"If you can travel there safely, finish with a daytime walk on the park’s walking path. Keep this as an optional off-campus stop rather than a required campus trip.","short_summary":"A simple downtown outdoor add-on.","evidence_claim":"The City of Huntsville lists Big Spring Park at 200 Church Street with passive greenspace and a walking path.","source_url":"https://www.huntsvilleal.gov/environment/parks-recreation/parks-and-nature/find-a-park/","source_title":"Find a Park | City of Huntsville","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Plan transportation and visit during daylight; follow posted City park rules.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
